/* 弹幕工作台 —— 对齐「高级弹幕工作台」设计稿：深色金调 / 玻璃卡片 / 城市天际线预览 */

page {
  /* 设计稿变量 */
  --gold: #d6a86b;
  --gold2: #f3d39b;
  --accent: #9d7cff;
  --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  --text: #f5f1ea;
  --muted: #9a9895;
  background: #0f1014;
}

.editor {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100vh;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #101116, #17181c 38%, #202126);
  color: var(--text);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.press { opacity: 0.75; }

/* ══════════ 自定义顶栏 ══════════ */
.topbar {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 116rpx;
  padding-left: 30rpx;
  padding-right: 30rpx;
  box-sizing: content-box;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(12, 13, 16, 0.76);
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
}
.tb-back {
  width: 72rpx;
  font-size: 60rpx;
  font-weight: 200;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--text);
  text-align: left;
}
.tb-mid { text-align: center; }
.tb-title {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}
.tb-sub {
  font-size: 16rpx;
  color: #85848a;
  letter-spacing: 4rpx;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}
.tb-more {
  min-width: 72rpx;
  text-align: right;
  border: 1rpx solid #65666b;
  border-radius: 44rpx;
  padding: 10rpx 20rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
  background: #18191d;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* ══════════ 预览区：城市天际线 ══════════ */
.preview {
  position: relative;
  height: 430rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}
/* 中央暖光晕 */
.pv-glow {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 60%, rgba(250, 181, 91, 0.35), transparent 25%);
}
/* 星点 + 斜向光带 */
.pv-fx {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.75;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 12% 25%, #fff 0 2rpx, transparent 4rpx),
    radial-gradient(circle at 76% 30%, #fff 0 2rpx, transparent 4rpx),
    radial-gradient(circle at 42% 18%, #fff 0 2rpx, transparent 4rpx),
    linear-gradient(165deg, transparent 58%, rgba(230, 172, 92, 0.23) 59%, transparent 61%);
}
/* 城市天际线剪影（在弹幕画布之下） */
.pv-city {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 136rpx;
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #08090d),
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 36rpx, #151a24 38rpx 56rpx, #252936 58rpx 70rpx);
  clip-path: polygon(0 55%, 4% 45%, 8% 63%, 12% 40%, 16% 58%, 20% 28%, 24% 60%, 29% 35%, 34% 52%, 39% 20%, 44% 57%, 49% 34%, 55% 61%, 60% 25%, 65% 55%, 70% 31%, 75% 62%, 81% 39%, 87% 55%, 92% 29%, 100% 57%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
}
/* 弹幕画布：透明底，浮在天际线之上 */
.pv-canvas {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
}
/* LIVE 徽标 */
.pv-live {
  position: absolute;
  right: 24rpx;
  top: 24rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 22rpx;
  border-radius: 36rpx;
  background: rgba(24, 25, 29, 0.86);
  border: 1rpx solid #e0bf83;
  color: #f4d8a5;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  z-index: 3;
}
.pv-live .dot {
  width: 12rpx;
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #59f0b1;
  box-shadow: 0 0 16rpx #59f0b1;
  margin-right: 10rpx;
}
/* 预览底部控件 */
.preview-bar {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 24rpx calc(16rpx + 8rpx);
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));
  z-index: 3;
}
.pb-btn {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  padding: 10rpx 24rpx;
  background: rgba(24, 25, 29, 0.86);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 32rpx;
}
.pb-name {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: right;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--muted);
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

/* ══════════ 主体滚动区 ══════════ */
.body {
  flex: 1;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.tail-space { height: 60rpx; }

/* 玻璃卡片 */
.card {
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(31, 33, 39, 0.96), rgba(20, 21, 25, 0.92));
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 36rpx;
  padding: 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 22rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 16rpx 56rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
}
.sec-title {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.sec-extra {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #999;
}
.sec-extra.link { color: var(--gold2); }

/* 输入条（点击唤起编辑弹窗） */
.input-bar {
  height: 104rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid #77716a;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  padding: 0 30rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: #15171b;
}
.input-ph { color: #8e8c8a; font-size: 28rpx; }
.input-count { margin-left: auto; color: #aaa; font-size: 24rpx; }

/* 分类 tabs */
.tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin: 22rpx 0;
  overflow-x: auto;
}
.tab {
  padding: 16rpx 26rpx;
  border-radius: 36rpx;
  background: #2b2d32;
  color: #aaa;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}
.tab.active {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9f7644, #e0b878);
  color: #17130e;
  box-shadow: 0 0 32rpx rgba(217, 166, 103, 0.2);
  font-weight: 800;
}

/* 模板瓦片：emoji 大字 + 文字小字 */
.tpl-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 14rpx;
}
.template {
  padding: 20rpx 10rpx;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  background: #2a2c30;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.tpl-emoji { font-size: 40rpx; margin-bottom: 10rpx; line-height: 1.2; }
.tpl-text {
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: #ddd;
  line-height: 1.35;
  max-height: 56rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* 灵感推荐 chips */
.suggestion {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14rpx;
  overflow-x: auto;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}
.chip {
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding: 16rpx 22rpx;
  border-radius: 34rpx;
  background: #26283a;
  border: 1rpx solid #5d5877;
  color: #ded8ff;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}
.chip-ai { color: var(--gold2); border-color: #6b5a3d; background: #2c2820; }

/* 已添加弹幕列表 */
.item-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}
.item-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border-radius: 18rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 20rpx;
}
.item-text {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.item-pin { color: var(--gold2); margin-right: 8rpx; }
.item-ops { display: flex; gap: 12rpx; }
.op {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  padding: 6rpx 18rpx;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
}
.op.on { background: var(--gold); color: #17130e; }
.op.del { background: rgba(255, 80, 80, 0.25); }
.empty-hint {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 20rpx 4rpx 4rpx;
}

.row-btns {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 22rpx;
}
.add-btn {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9d7549, #d3a36a);
  color: #17120c;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.add-btn.ghost {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* ══════════ 表情网格 ══════════ */
.emoji-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr);
  gap: 14rpx;
}
.emoji {
  height: 92rpx;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: #2a2c30;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 48rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid transparent;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.emoji.active {
  border-color: #dfb875;
  box-shadow: 0 0 32rpx rgba(216, 168, 96, 0.2);
  background: #38332b;
}

/* ══════════ 文字样式 ══════════ */
.style-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14rpx;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin: 18rpx 0;
}
.row-label {
  width: 76rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  color: #a5a3a1;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 60rpx;
}
.swatches {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  flex: 1;
}
.swatch {
  width: 60rpx;
  height: 60rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 4rpx solid transparent;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.swatch.active {
  border-color: #f5d38f;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4rpx #8f6a3b;
}
.swatch.more {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  color: var(--gold2);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}
.bg-chip {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 60rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.bg-chip.active {
  border-color: #f5d38f;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4rpx #8f6a3b;
}

/* pills */
.pills {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12rpx;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  flex: 1;
}
.pills.vertical { flex-direction: column; }
.pills.vertical .pill { text-align: center; }
.pill {
  padding: 14rpx 24rpx;
  border-radius: 34rpx;
  background: #292b30;
  color: #8f8d8a;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid transparent;
}
.pill.active {
  color: #fff1d4;
  border-color: #caa263;
  background: #6b5135;
}

/* 开关组 */
.toggles {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}
.tog {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 26rpx;
  background: #292b30;
  color: #8f8d8a;
  border-radius: 34rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid transparent;
}
.tog.on {
  color: #fff1d4;
  border-color: #caa263;
  background: #6b5135;
}

/* ══════════ 布局与密度 ══════════ */
.control-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr 0.7fr;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.cg-col { min-width: 0; }
.mini-title {
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: #aaa;
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
}
.crown {
  height: 88rpx;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #292b30;
  border: 1rpx solid #45474c;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 40rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.crown.active {
  border-color: #d2a765;
  background: #44372a;
  box-shadow: 0 0 24rpx rgba(210, 167, 101, 0.25);
}

/* ══════════ 节日皮肤 ══════════ */
.skin-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 14rpx;
}
.skin {
  height: 110rpx;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding-bottom: 8rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.skin-emoji { font-size: 30rpx; line-height: 1.1; }
.skin-label {
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: #fff;
  text-shadow: 0 2rpx 8rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}
.skin.active {
  border: 4rpx solid #dfbd7c;
  box-shadow: 0 0 30rpx rgba(213, 167, 99, 0.2);
}

/* ══════════ 底部操作栏 ══════════ */
.ab-hint {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  padding: 10rpx 24rpx 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
}
.action-bar {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1.12fr;
  gap: 14rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 20rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(18rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: rgba(15, 16, 19, 0.9);
  border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}
.ab-btn {
  height: 94rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #34363b;
  color: #eee;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.ab-btn.faved {
  color: #fff1d4;
  border: 1rpx solid #caa263;
  background: #6b5135;
}
.ab-btn.primary {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9d7549, #d3a36a);
  color: #17120c;
  font-weight: 800;
  box-shadow: 0 8rpx 36rpx rgba(211, 163, 106, 0.21);
}

/* ══════════ 弹窗 ══════════ */
.modal-mask {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 200;
}
.modal {
  width: 84%;
  background: #20222a;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 24rpx 80rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}
.modal-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}
.item-input {
  width: 100%;
  height: 160rpx;
  background: #15171b;
  border: 1rpx solid #77716a;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 20rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--text);
}
.modal-btns {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 24rpx;
}
.mb {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 18rpx;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
.mb.cancel { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #ccc; }
.mb.ok {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9d7549, #d3a36a);
  color: #17120c;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* 取色面板 */
.picker-grid {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12rpx;
}
.pc { display: flex; gap: 12rpx; }
.pc-cell {
  flex: 1;
  height: 60rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

/* 导出进度 */
.modal-mask2 {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 300;
}
.export-box {
  width: 70%;
  background: #20222a;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 40rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
.export-hint {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}
.progress-track {
  height: 16rpx;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #9d7549, #e0b878);
  transition: width 0.2s;
}
.export-pct {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--muted);
}
